### 1. The Five Affective States

```
Level 0  ───  NOMINAL
             "I'm fine. Watching, but relaxed."
             Soft idle lights • quiet • low attention

Level 1  ───  NOTICING
             "Hmm… that was different."
             Brief attention flash • soft chirp • mild curiosity

Level 2  ───  INVESTIGATING
             "I need a closer look."
             Directed lights/head • inquisitive sounds • active scanning

Level 3  ───  CONCERNED
             "This doesn’t feel right."
             Warning colors/pulse • caution tones • defensive posture

Level 4  ───  PROTECTIVE
             "Shutting non-essentials. Protecting core."
             Strong alert / power-down sequence • cut non-critical loads
```

Simple progression:

```
NOMINAL  →  NOTICING  →  INVESTIGATING  →  CONCERNED  →  PROTECTIVE
   ↑                                                       |
   └─────────────── quiet time / reset ────────────────────┘
```

